822	On FOLIO-204 with the corrected SC baseline (alphabetical tiebreaking), SICA improves over SC by $+$3.4\,pp overall (55.9\% $\to$ 59.3\%), though the aggregate McNemar test is marginally non-significant ($p{=}.092$).
